```
Iterate active contracts with end_date not null. If end < today → status berakhir. If days <=30 → akan_berakhir. If in [30,14,7] → notify. Return counts. Recipients: NotificationService role hrd, kepala_bagian. Message includes contract number, employee name, end date, days left. dedupe key `contract:{id}:h{days}`. Send to role hrd and kepala_bagian. Note kepala_bagian all, or scope unit? Design says HRD and kepala bagian. Send all kepala_bagian. Could scope to employee unit but NotificationService doesn't filter; acceptable perhaps not. Better to match by employee org unit? Implement custom users: hrd all + kepala_bagian whose scoped unit includes employee unit. Add method? In ContractService:
