```php
$active = assignments whereNull effective_to;
foreach active: if effective_from->lt(effective_date) update effective_to = effective_date-1; else delete? 
```
Better validate `effective_date` >= today, and active assignments started before. For edge, set effective_to = effective_date->subDay(); if active effective_from > that, update effective_from? Avoid complexity; validation error if active.effective_from >= effective_date: "Tanggal efektif harus setelah penempatan aktif dimulai." That's reasonable.
